WEBVTT

00:31.447 --> 00:34.997
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.017 --> 00:38.397
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.667 --> 00:44.637
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.797 --> 00:49.427
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.447 --> 00:52.957
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:52.977 --> 00:56.467
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.487 --> 00:59.997
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.017 --> 01:06.077
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.337 --> 01:23.617
Si Jin

01:23.637 --> 01:27.617
Episode 22

01:27.617 --> 01:31.137
(Capital Security Office)

01:31.667 --> 01:33.097
Mr. Zhou, please come inside.

01:33.117 --> 01:34.227
Mr. Zhen and Mr. Yu

01:34.227 --> 01:36.107
have been waiting for you.

01:37.867 --> 01:39.227
Please.

01:46.307 --> 01:47.567
Mr. Zhou.

01:47.587 --> 01:48.767
Mr. Zhou.

01:48.787 --> 01:50.147
Mr. Zhen.

01:50.917 --> 01:53.107
Come on in.

01:53.587 --> 01:54.947
Please.

01:59.437 --> 02:00.937
Mr. Zhen, you're too kind.

02:00.957 --> 02:02.837
My pleasure. Please, take a seat.

02:02.837 --> 02:05.027
Mr. Zhou, your imposing presence

02:05.027 --> 02:06.327
and remarkable demeanor

02:06.347 --> 02:07.717
are almost intimidating!

02:07.717 --> 02:09.077
Pour the wine.

02:12.627 --> 02:13.987
Mr. Zhen,

02:14.147 --> 02:15.837
what's this for?

02:16.907 --> 02:18.997
I fear we offended you last night.

02:19.587 --> 02:20.607
Mr. Yu and I

02:20.627 --> 02:22.437
prepared this meal specifically

02:22.907 --> 02:24.597
to make amends.

02:24.867 --> 02:26.377
Thank you, gentlemen.

02:26.397 --> 02:27.757
Here's to you.

02:33.237 --> 02:35.697
From a military background,

02:35.717 --> 02:37.817
I'm unversed

02:37.837 --> 02:39.467
in the ways of the official circle.

02:39.717 --> 02:42.537
I beg your understanding, Mr. Zhen.

02:42.557 --> 02:43.997
Let the wine speak for us. Come on.

02:43.997 --> 02:45.357
Ok.

02:48.437 --> 02:51.067
Isn't this a case

02:51.187 --> 02:52.257
of family

02:52.277 --> 02:54.227
turning against family?

02:54.397 --> 02:56.497
Exactly, exactly.

02:56.517 --> 02:57.447
Mr. Zhou,

02:57.467 --> 02:58.937
you may not know,

02:58.957 --> 03:00.097
Commandant Yu

03:00.117 --> 03:02.497
hails from the South Chiyu Cavalry

03:02.517 --> 03:03.997
and only recently assumed his post

03:03.997 --> 03:05.217
in Ling'an.

03:05.237 --> 03:07.627
No wonder he seems unfamiliar.

03:08.277 --> 03:09.497
At first glance,

03:09.517 --> 03:11.167
his exceptional bearing

03:11.187 --> 03:13.047
marks him as a valiant warrior,

03:13.067 --> 03:14.677
a true blessing to us all.

03:14.677 --> 03:15.997
I'm flattered, Mr. Zhou.

03:15.997 --> 03:17.597
Here is to you.

03:23.997 --> 03:25.747
This stupid thing

03:26.517 --> 03:28.787
is really in the way!

03:29.517 --> 03:30.447
Mr. Zhen,

03:30.467 --> 03:32.667
I have to thank you.

03:32.837 --> 03:34.727
You've worked hard.

03:34.747 --> 03:36.107
Cheers.

03:36.907 --> 03:38.317
Mr. Zhou,

03:38.717 --> 03:39.557
take a look.

03:39.557 --> 03:41.177
Is this your name?

03:41.177 --> 03:42.347
(Contractor: Zhou Yi)

03:42.347 --> 03:45.317
Yes, I signed it.

03:45.437 --> 03:47.377
Look, isn't this my name?

03:47.397 --> 03:48.437
This contract

03:48.437 --> 03:50.887
came without effort,

03:50.907 --> 03:51.797
Mr. Zhen.

03:51.797 --> 03:54.557
You check it. I'll be right back.

03:55.957 --> 03:57.317
Fill it.

04:00.997 --> 04:02.597
Thank you, Mr. Zhen.

04:10.507 --> 04:12.867
Look carefully, Mr. Zhou.

04:13.117 --> 04:16.097
Did you sign it?

04:16.117 --> 04:18.837
Yes, I signed it.

04:20.187 --> 04:22.457
To my shame,

04:22.477 --> 04:24.847
I owed 1,000 taels in gambling debts.

04:24.867 --> 04:26.827
They wouldn't let me go until I signed.

04:26.827 --> 04:28.847
Those thugs' petty tricks

04:28.867 --> 04:30.307
are not worth mentioning.

04:38.867 --> 04:40.217
Mr. Yu,

04:40.237 --> 04:42.517
are you putting on a blade show?

04:43.827 --> 04:45.187
Come on.

04:45.477 --> 04:46.797
Tens of thousands

04:46.797 --> 04:48.557
of our Chiyu Cavalrymen

04:48.557 --> 04:50.287
were killed in action!

04:50.307 --> 04:52.907
Yet you signed such a humiliating treaty.

04:53.557 --> 04:55.597
Mr. Yu, please don't.

04:56.767 --> 04:58.637
Swords have no eyes.

05:02.387 --> 05:03.977
Watch out, Mr. Zhou.

05:03.997 --> 05:05.677
- You tell me...
- Be careful, Mr. Zhou.

05:05.677 --> 05:07.837
- Mr. Zhou!
- Watch out, sir!

05:08.187 --> 05:09.547
Mr. Zhou.

05:09.707 --> 05:11.687
Don't be afraid.

05:11.707 --> 05:14.597
Mr. Yu has always been hot-headed.

05:15.557 --> 05:17.097
Just tell him

05:17.117 --> 05:18.367
what he wants to know.

05:18.387 --> 05:19.237
No, no.

05:19.237 --> 05:20.597
Speak!

05:21.117 --> 05:22.417
Alright, I'll talk.

05:22.437 --> 05:23.417
I'll talk. I'll talk.

05:23.437 --> 05:24.797
I'll talk.

05:25.677 --> 05:27.417
I owed them 1,000 taels in gambling debts

05:27.437 --> 05:28.777
and asked for a few days' extension,

05:28.797 --> 05:30.217
but they refused.

05:30.237 --> 05:31.687
Then they pressed me

05:31.707 --> 05:34.397
about my role

05:34.627 --> 05:35.977
in the autumn hunting

05:35.997 --> 05:37.637
and I told them everything.

05:37.947 --> 05:39.837
What are you doing?

05:39.917 --> 05:41.017
Don't kill me!

05:41.037 --> 05:42.237
I'll do anything!

05:42.237 --> 05:43.117
Anything!

05:43.117 --> 05:44.477
Anything?

05:44.677 --> 05:46.197
Anything, yes!

05:46.197 --> 05:49.817
(Banker)

05:50.977 --> 05:53.897
(Contractor: Zhou Yi)

06:01.357 --> 06:03.637
You're with the Nightingale Division!

06:04.747 --> 06:06.137
Once it is done,

06:06.157 --> 06:07.307
your 1,000-tael debt

06:07.307 --> 06:08.757
will be erased,

06:08.797 --> 06:10.757
and we'll return the contract.

06:13.827 --> 06:15.867
This isn't a contract.

06:16.037 --> 06:19.197
It's a death warrant!

06:20.437 --> 06:22.467
What we ask is simple.

06:22.707 --> 06:24.067
Don't worry.

06:24.867 --> 06:26.287
In the autumn hunting,

06:26.307 --> 06:28.247
replace all the procession's candles

06:28.267 --> 06:30.347
with what I gave you.

06:30.797 --> 06:32.157
That's all.

06:32.677 --> 06:33.927
Cut the crap!

06:33.947 --> 06:35.307
Get to the point.

06:38.627 --> 06:40.757
They are with the Nightingale Division.

06:41.267 --> 06:43.367
I had no choice.

06:43.387 --> 06:44.537
They promised

06:44.557 --> 06:46.477
if I replaced all the procession's candles

06:46.477 --> 06:48.277
with theirs,

06:48.797 --> 06:49.827
my 1,000-tael debt

06:49.827 --> 06:51.137
would be written off,

06:51.157 --> 06:53.547
and they'd return the contract.

06:56.067 --> 06:57.367
The candles they gave you

06:57.387 --> 06:59.077
won't light, right?

07:01.867 --> 07:02.997
You're right, Miss.

07:02.997 --> 07:04.357
Exactly.

07:05.477 --> 07:06.627
But thinking it through,

07:06.627 --> 07:08.777
what harm could there be?

07:08.797 --> 07:10.307
His Majesty will have returned

07:10.307 --> 07:11.607
to the palace before dark.

07:11.627 --> 07:14.277
The candles wouldn't even be needed.

07:14.387 --> 07:15.687
I have no idea

07:15.707 --> 07:17.457
what they're really planning.

07:17.477 --> 07:18.457
I've recorded

07:18.477 --> 07:19.867
everything he just said.

07:22.387 --> 07:24.227
Seems the Nightingale Division

07:24.267 --> 07:26.727
anticipated the solar eclipse

07:26.747 --> 07:28.807
and aimed to exploit it.

07:28.827 --> 07:32.907
This serves as solid evidence.

07:39.887 --> 07:43.107
Mr. Zhen, please help me!

07:43.267 --> 07:44.627
Mr. Zhou,

07:45.477 --> 07:47.657
your treason

07:47.677 --> 07:49.547
is proven beyond doubt.

07:50.507 --> 07:52.307
That's a capital offense.

07:52.677 --> 07:54.657
I beg you!

07:54.677 --> 07:56.537
I've already told you

07:56.557 --> 07:58.247
I was coerced!

07:58.267 --> 07:59.997
I've told you everything I know!

07:59.997 --> 08:01.637
Oh, oh...

08:04.827 --> 08:06.307
Mr. Zhou,

08:07.267 --> 08:09.667
perhaps you should think again.

08:09.867 --> 08:10.747
See if you can

08:10.747 --> 08:12.597
recall more

08:12.677 --> 08:15.167
and give me a reason

08:15.187 --> 08:17.227
to spare your head.

08:17.827 --> 08:19.717
- Don't keep threatening me.
- Mr. Zhou,

08:20.437 --> 08:22.037
don't be nervous.

08:24.677 --> 08:26.277
Think carefully.

08:26.707 --> 08:27.797
If you can provide

08:27.797 --> 08:29.377
something more valuable,

08:29.397 --> 08:30.827
perhaps

08:31.187 --> 08:33.117
Mr. Yu will spare your life.

08:35.637 --> 08:37.427
Think, think.

08:37.687 --> 08:39.047
I'm thinking.

08:39.107 --> 08:40.467
Let me think.

08:44.187 --> 08:45.547
Oh,

08:45.877 --> 08:46.757
there is a Palace Woman

08:46.757 --> 08:48.137
with the Food Service

08:48.157 --> 08:50.657
named,

08:50.677 --> 08:51.557
named Aling.

08:51.557 --> 08:52.967
Yes, Aling.

08:52.987 --> 08:53.827
Her brother

08:53.827 --> 08:55.377
also lost money gambling.

08:55.397 --> 08:56.307
I saw her

08:56.307 --> 08:58.547
bail him out myself.

08:58.587 --> 09:01.087
If she's accompanying the hunting,

09:01.107 --> 09:02.447
I bet

09:02.467 --> 09:04.277
she'll tamper

09:04.277 --> 09:06.137
with His Majesty's meals!

09:06.157 --> 09:07.907
Help sketch her likeness.

09:08.157 --> 09:09.777
- Can you do it?
- Yes.

09:09.797 --> 09:10.897
Good.

09:10.917 --> 09:12.277
Long Dan.

09:14.347 --> 09:15.877
Mr. Zhou,

09:16.277 --> 09:17.667
be careful.

09:19.397 --> 09:21.667
Does this count as atonement?

09:21.827 --> 09:23.167
Please, please.

09:23.187 --> 09:25.157
- I'll go sketch her.
- Hurry up!

09:26.157 --> 09:28.357
Watch your blade.

09:29.677 --> 09:31.307
Given the gravity of this matter,

09:31.557 --> 09:33.427
I must draft a memorial

09:34.027 --> 09:35.207
to His Majesty immediately.

09:35.227 --> 09:36.587
- No.
- No.

09:41.757 --> 09:43.857
We don't know how many spies

09:43.877 --> 09:45.467
have been planted in the palace

09:45.467 --> 09:46.687
through this gambling den.

09:46.707 --> 09:48.537
If your memorial is discovered,

09:48.557 --> 09:49.517
it could force them

09:49.517 --> 09:50.687
to alter their plans,

09:50.707 --> 09:53.357
making them even harder to predict.

09:53.827 --> 09:55.137
Exactly.

09:55.157 --> 09:57.377
The enemy is exposed; we're hidden.

09:57.397 --> 09:58.897
Rather than baiting them out,

09:58.917 --> 10:01.237
let them walk into the trap.

10:05.777 --> 10:09.297
(Jiang)

10:25.187 --> 10:26.587
Is it enough, Miss?

10:29.987 --> 10:31.467
The water is freezing.

10:31.467 --> 10:33.237
How can you bathe in this?

10:39.227 --> 10:40.707
You did well.

10:41.947 --> 10:43.897
Here, take this.

10:43.917 --> 10:45.517
Don't tell anyone.

10:46.277 --> 10:47.637
Leave now.

10:48.037 --> 10:49.477
Thank you, Miss.

11:39.067 --> 11:40.427
How is she?

11:40.757 --> 11:43.167
She has a fever from the cold.

11:43.187 --> 11:44.947
Take the prescribed medicine, stay warm,

11:44.947 --> 11:46.857
and she'll recover in a few days.

11:46.877 --> 11:48.707
- Thank you, doctor.
- Certainly.

11:57.917 --> 11:59.877
How did she get such a high fever?

12:00.827 --> 12:03.357
This isn't even the season for colds.

12:14.947 --> 12:16.397
I have something to ask you.

12:20.757 --> 12:22.227
She really knows how to pick

12:22.227 --> 12:24.257
the worst timing to fall ill.

12:24.277 --> 12:25.827
The Xiao Family has their sickly one,

12:25.827 --> 12:27.277
and we've got our frail one.

12:27.277 --> 12:29.357
How can they go on a blind date?

12:29.797 --> 12:33.037
Presumably, it's their trick.

12:34.637 --> 12:36.157
Fever at this timing,

12:36.157 --> 12:37.497
Concubine Ruan

12:37.517 --> 12:38.757
is probably

12:38.757 --> 12:40.587
playing some trick.

12:41.467 --> 12:43.907
She really spares no expense.

12:44.067 --> 12:45.257
Shall we use strong medicine

12:45.277 --> 12:46.807
to speed her recovery?

12:46.827 --> 12:48.187
No.

12:48.917 --> 12:50.477
Pick her a dress

12:50.547 --> 12:51.517
and jewels,

12:51.517 --> 12:53.157
the finest ones.

12:53.467 --> 12:54.797
As long as she's breathing,

12:54.797 --> 12:57.547
she'll show up radiant.

12:58.067 --> 12:59.567
- I don't believe
- Yes.

12:59.587 --> 13:01.477
I can't break her defiance.

13:01.887 --> 13:02.877
Are you just going to stay sick

13:02.877 --> 13:04.667
and ruin your health?

13:06.827 --> 13:08.187
Mother,

13:09.557 --> 13:11.547
you know already?

13:13.187 --> 13:15.087
Tomorrow's matchmaking meeting,

13:15.107 --> 13:17.517
the Xiao Family won't be pleased

13:17.707 --> 13:19.067
to see me gravely ill.

13:19.067 --> 13:19.947
If I'd known

13:19.947 --> 13:21.067
this was your plan,

13:21.067 --> 13:22.997
I wouldn't have allowed your recklessness.

13:23.467 --> 13:25.287
I don't want to cause more trouble,

13:25.307 --> 13:27.157
leading Grandma and Father

13:27.157 --> 13:29.137
to blame you again.

13:29.157 --> 13:31.857
This meeting is unavoidable.

13:31.877 --> 13:33.587
Given the circumstances,

13:33.877 --> 13:35.107
no matter what Mr. Xiao

13:35.107 --> 13:36.347
is like,

13:36.347 --> 13:39.187
I refuse to be tied to him.

13:39.587 --> 13:41.637
This is my only recourse.

13:42.437 --> 13:44.187
My poor Qiao.

13:46.037 --> 13:47.947
I should be blamed for incompetence.

13:50.397 --> 13:51.757
Mother,

13:52.187 --> 13:54.067
don't say that.

13:59.777 --> 14:03.297
(Cultivate Virtue and Uphold Righteousness)

14:09.917 --> 14:11.677
Ma'am prepared these for Miss Qiao's

14:11.677 --> 14:13.257
matchmaking meeting tomorrow,

14:13.277 --> 14:15.137
all the finest.

14:15.157 --> 14:16.927
Qiao is seriously ill.

14:16.947 --> 14:18.897
How can you still think of the meeting?

14:18.917 --> 14:20.657
Mind your words.

14:20.677 --> 14:22.687
The Xiao Family is a distinguished line.

14:22.707 --> 14:24.347
With Miss Qiao's radiant presence,

14:24.347 --> 14:25.557
the entire household

14:25.557 --> 14:27.967
stands to gain greater prestige.

14:27.987 --> 14:29.157
As for the fever,

14:29.157 --> 14:30.397
rest properly today.

14:30.397 --> 14:31.447
A night's sleep

14:31.467 --> 14:33.087
will surely bring improvement.

14:33.107 --> 14:34.307
What kind of talk is that?

14:34.307 --> 14:35.667
Mother.

14:43.277 --> 14:44.637
Thank you.

14:45.677 --> 14:47.707
Too bad Pei left so soon.

14:48.557 --> 14:49.517
She should've seen

14:49.517 --> 14:50.777
Ma'am's kindness

14:50.797 --> 14:51.917
to decide if she'd still

14:51.917 --> 14:53.207
do you a favor.

14:53.227 --> 14:54.687
Favor, seriously?

14:54.707 --> 14:56.017
Mother,

14:56.037 --> 14:57.807
forced fruit won't ripen sweet.

14:57.827 --> 14:59.207
Since Qiao resists,

14:59.227 --> 15:01.537
I beg you to show mercy

15:01.557 --> 15:02.997
and not to force her.

15:03.107 --> 15:04.567
If I may speak plainly,

15:04.587 --> 15:06.567
Ms. Jiang Pei is far more resourceful

15:06.587 --> 15:09.067
than before.

15:09.187 --> 15:11.277
I shall take my leave now.

15:23.877 --> 15:25.787
I misjudged Pei.

15:25.947 --> 15:27.787
I wronged her

15:27.827 --> 15:28.797
and uttered

15:28.797 --> 15:30.517
so many harsh words.

15:31.107 --> 15:33.087
How heartbroken she must be.

15:33.107 --> 15:34.467
I'm no better.

15:34.637 --> 15:36.537
I didn't try to keep her,

15:36.557 --> 15:39.277
assuming it was a momentary lapse.

15:40.517 --> 15:41.877
In hindsight,

15:42.107 --> 15:43.877
how disheartened she must have been.

16:20.827 --> 16:22.307
They haven't come.

16:37.707 --> 16:38.627
What's this?

16:38.647 --> 16:39.897
Don't worry and go ahead, Miss Qiao.

16:39.917 --> 16:41.477
The Xiao Family won't come.

16:50.987 --> 16:52.347
This...

17:02.227 --> 17:03.547
How could the Xiaos

17:03.547 --> 17:04.927
break their promise?

17:04.947 --> 17:06.157
We've waited a whole day

17:06.157 --> 17:07.767
without even a message.

17:07.787 --> 17:09.197
Enough, enough.

17:09.547 --> 17:12.067
We've done all we could in good faith.

17:12.397 --> 17:14.577
Is this truly over?

17:14.597 --> 17:15.687
Of course.

17:15.707 --> 17:17.117
How can we forge a marriage alliance

17:17.117 --> 17:18.857
with a family putting on airs

17:18.877 --> 17:20.167
at the first meeting?

17:20.187 --> 17:21.727
Blame that Xiao woman

17:21.747 --> 17:23.057
for picking such a family.

17:23.077 --> 17:24.437
Father,

17:24.507 --> 17:26.627
don't upset yourself.

17:28.357 --> 17:31.337
Qiao, you've borne enough these days.

17:31.357 --> 17:32.687
You're still unwell.

17:32.707 --> 17:34.387
Go rest now.

17:35.637 --> 17:37.197
- I'm leaving.
- Alright.

17:39.917 --> 17:41.437
My goodness.

17:45.747 --> 17:48.277
Mother, this is wonderful!

17:48.677 --> 17:50.967
Oh, who told you to deliver the letter?

17:50.987 --> 17:52.997
Please wait. I'll bring her.

17:53.507 --> 17:55.437
Finally, it's all over.

17:55.707 --> 17:57.027
It's for the best

17:57.027 --> 17:58.827
this match didn't happen.

18:05.507 --> 18:07.527
Mother, Qiao.

18:07.547 --> 18:08.657
Pei?

18:08.677 --> 18:10.037
Pei?

18:10.227 --> 18:11.547
Was it you?

18:11.547 --> 18:13.767
Come, sit down. Let's talk seated.

18:13.787 --> 18:15.717
You didn't return to your husband's family?

18:15.987 --> 18:18.107
I stayed at an inn for a few days.

18:18.267 --> 18:20.147
How could I see you

18:20.597 --> 18:22.417
with this matter unsolved?

18:22.437 --> 18:24.587
How exactly did you manage it?

18:25.747 --> 18:27.487
I wrote to my husband.

18:27.507 --> 18:28.437
His family,

18:28.437 --> 18:30.297
leveraging ties to the Xiaos,

18:30.317 --> 18:32.207
learned of the letter's dispatch time.

18:32.227 --> 18:35.007
They told the messenger they'd deliver it.

18:35.027 --> 18:36.487
In fact,

18:36.507 --> 18:37.817
they secretly

18:37.837 --> 18:40.107
intercepted the letter.

18:40.357 --> 18:41.917
With no reply reaching the Xiaos,

18:41.917 --> 18:42.947
they naturally assumed

18:42.947 --> 18:44.337
we were not interested.

18:44.357 --> 18:45.997
So, they wouldn't come.

18:46.027 --> 18:47.627
I owe this to you.

18:47.787 --> 18:49.747
I misjudged you so harshly before.

18:49.747 --> 18:51.007
I'm sorry, Pei.

18:51.027 --> 18:52.917
I was blind to the truth.

18:55.077 --> 18:57.337
Actually,

18:57.357 --> 18:58.857
I've been reflecting these days.

18:58.877 --> 18:59.987
I was

18:59.987 --> 19:01.687
headstrong and impulsive in the past,

19:01.707 --> 19:03.057
always getting into trouble.

19:03.077 --> 19:04.267
But you still regarded me

19:04.267 --> 19:05.867
as family.

19:05.947 --> 19:07.417
So, there's no way

19:07.437 --> 19:09.627
I can hold a grudge this time.

19:09.877 --> 19:11.717
I was wrong too.

19:11.747 --> 19:13.107
See,

19:13.267 --> 19:15.067
I have two such good daughters.

19:15.267 --> 19:17.867
I failed to see clearly.

19:18.877 --> 19:21.097
My Pei has grown up.

19:21.117 --> 19:22.857
You've gotten smarter, Pei.

19:22.877 --> 19:24.347
I was never stupid.

19:26.157 --> 19:27.627
I have to go now.

19:28.947 --> 19:29.877
I returned secretly

19:29.877 --> 19:31.897
to visit you this time.

19:31.917 --> 19:33.057
Let it be assumed

19:33.077 --> 19:34.927
I left for my husband's family that day.

19:34.947 --> 19:36.267
Even if the intercepted letter

19:36.267 --> 19:37.617
is discovered someday,

19:37.637 --> 19:39.137
it'll be hard to trace back to me.

19:39.157 --> 19:40.687
This way, everyone stays safe.

19:40.707 --> 19:43.147
Alright, we'll follow your lead.

19:43.397 --> 19:44.917
You must be careful.

19:44.987 --> 19:46.117
Come back whenever you can,

19:46.117 --> 19:47.547
and write often.

19:49.317 --> 19:51.307
As long as our hearts remain united,

19:51.357 --> 19:53.037
we'll never truly part.

20:11.857 --> 20:14.417
(The autumn wind hunts)

20:17.677 --> 20:19.677
Come on, try this.

20:23.877 --> 20:25.517
Is this the Nanwu language?

20:26.707 --> 20:28.057
Know your enemy as yourself

20:28.077 --> 20:29.787
and you can prevail in every battle.

20:30.317 --> 20:31.397
I believe

20:31.397 --> 20:32.687
knowing your enemy as yourself

20:32.707 --> 20:34.437
leads to victory without battle.

20:36.267 --> 20:37.297
Why?

20:37.317 --> 20:38.857
Behind every casualty

20:38.877 --> 20:40.867
lies a shattered family.

20:40.917 --> 20:42.157
If Dazhou and Nanwu

20:42.157 --> 20:43.157
had more individuals

20:43.157 --> 20:44.487
like General Yu who were willing

20:44.507 --> 20:46.207
to know their enemies as themselves,

20:46.227 --> 20:47.707
grievances would dissolve

20:47.707 --> 20:48.857
into coexistence.

20:48.877 --> 20:50.377
Wouldn't that be

20:50.397 --> 20:52.387
victory without battles for both sides?

20:54.987 --> 20:56.717
Your vision is profound, Si.

20:56.837 --> 20:58.197
I'm enlightened.

20:58.547 --> 21:00.067
Is it good?

21:00.227 --> 21:01.587
Try it.

21:05.877 --> 21:07.857
You've mastered

21:07.877 --> 21:09.517
our Nanwu script well.

21:10.987 --> 21:12.347
Thanks, Grand Elder.

21:17.437 --> 21:19.247
(Yu Qi only learned the Nanwu language)

21:19.267 --> 21:21.277
(after I arrived in the South.)

21:21.507 --> 21:23.717
(How is he proficient already?)

21:24.597 --> 21:25.767
(No matter, )

21:25.787 --> 21:27.377
(perhaps the threads of fate)

21:27.397 --> 21:28.867
(have shifted.)

21:29.707 --> 21:30.687
(Tomorrow)

21:30.707 --> 21:32.817
(is His Majesty's hunting.)

21:32.837 --> 21:33.837
(If Yu Qi)

21:33.837 --> 21:35.787
(succeeds at the hunt, )

21:35.947 --> 21:37.297
(the next step will be)

21:37.317 --> 21:39.817
(a full crackdown on the Nightingale.)

21:39.837 --> 21:41.417
(What can I do)

21:41.437 --> 21:43.347
(to protect Senior Du and the others?)

21:52.747 --> 21:54.107
Miss Jiang.

22:00.917 --> 22:02.387
Ready to go?

22:02.707 --> 22:04.067
Yes.

22:04.437 --> 22:05.957
Be careful.

22:06.117 --> 22:07.477
Don't worry.

22:08.877 --> 22:09.877
When I gave the sachet

22:09.877 --> 22:11.597
to my brother that day,

22:11.597 --> 22:14.197
I actually made one for you, too.

22:16.467 --> 22:18.067
Let me fasten it for you.

22:23.317 --> 22:25.047
♪ From place to place ♪

22:25.047 --> 22:29.987
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

22:30.357 --> 22:32.737
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

22:32.737 --> 22:36.967
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

22:37.677 --> 22:40.077
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

22:40.097 --> 22:44.057
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

22:44.187 --> 22:45.547
Done.

22:48.947 --> 22:50.307
Bye.

22:53.687 --> 22:57.257
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

22:57.277 --> 23:01.507
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

23:01.527 --> 23:03.307
♪ Time glows ♪

23:03.307 --> 23:07.727
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

23:07.747 --> 23:08.687
Er'niu,

23:08.707 --> 23:09.707
come on.

23:09.707 --> 23:11.627
Take us to the Capital Security.

23:12.357 --> 23:13.717
Let's go.

23:13.837 --> 23:15.197
Good boy.

23:15.777 --> 23:18.417
(Zhou)

23:24.507 --> 23:26.437
Today's grand autumn hunting

23:26.507 --> 23:28.247
is graced by His Majesty's presence.

23:28.267 --> 23:29.897
We, the Imperial Insignia Guard,

23:29.917 --> 23:31.767
must discharge our duties

23:31.787 --> 23:33.787
and swear to safeguard the grounds!

23:33.787 --> 23:35.197
Yes!

23:41.157 --> 23:44.617
Today's grand autumn hunting

23:44.637 --> 23:46.297
is graced by His Majesty's presence.

23:46.317 --> 23:47.857
We, the Speed Guards,

23:47.877 --> 23:50.617
must discharge our duties

23:50.637 --> 23:53.857
and swear to safeguard the grounds!

23:53.877 --> 23:55.237
Yes!

24:00.257 --> 24:03.777
(Zhou)

24:10.627 --> 24:12.077
Mr. Yang is already here.

24:12.227 --> 24:13.077
Yes.

24:13.077 --> 24:14.857
I've had someone swap the candles back.

24:14.877 --> 24:17.037
The only problem is Aling, the Palace Woman.

24:17.357 --> 24:19.387
We must find her before the ceremony.

24:19.987 --> 24:21.867
Two officials from the Capital Security.

24:23.187 --> 24:26.107
Mr. Zhen, Commandant Yu, go ahead.

24:26.917 --> 24:29.147
Guards and attendants, no entry allowed.

24:29.597 --> 24:30.507
You go back first.

24:30.507 --> 24:31.867
Yes.

24:36.267 --> 24:37.627
Let's split up.

24:38.747 --> 24:41.867
Mr. Zhao, how have you been?

24:43.737 --> 24:47.057
(Capital Security Office)

24:47.057 --> 24:52.417
(Prison)

24:52.437 --> 24:53.577
What's up?

24:53.597 --> 24:55.157
Mr. Yu sent this young lady

24:55.157 --> 24:56.817
to question Sang Qi.

24:56.837 --> 24:58.187
The Capital Security regulations state

24:58.187 --> 24:59.637
no unauthorized entry

24:59.637 --> 25:00.687
unless Mr. Zhen or Mr. Yu

25:00.707 --> 25:02.897
are present.

25:02.917 --> 25:04.117
I was present

25:04.117 --> 25:05.577
during Zhou Yi's interrogation.

25:05.597 --> 25:07.657
Surely I know Mr. Yu's plan.

25:07.677 --> 25:09.007
I'm here to question Sang Qi

25:09.027 --> 25:10.437
because I need to

25:10.437 --> 25:12.587
verify some details with him.

25:12.677 --> 25:13.677
But...

25:13.677 --> 25:15.367
This concerns the autumn hunting.

25:15.387 --> 25:16.617
Can you bear the consequences

25:16.637 --> 25:17.967
if something goes wrong?

25:17.987 --> 25:18.837
This is a restricted area.

25:18.837 --> 25:20.037
We're just doing our duty,

25:20.037 --> 25:21.357
please don't make things difficult for us.

25:21.357 --> 25:22.637
Mr. Zhen and Mr. Yu

25:22.637 --> 25:24.617
have departed for the Mount Cuiluo hunt,

25:24.637 --> 25:26.767
which is why I've come with Er'niu.

25:26.787 --> 25:28.147
Moreover, here is

25:29.077 --> 25:31.067
(Capital Security Office)
Mr. Yu's waist tag.

25:31.077 --> 25:33.717
Are you still not convinced, officers?

25:34.317 --> 25:35.927
Er'niu has Mr. Yu's full trust

25:35.947 --> 25:36.987
and she has the waist tag.

25:36.987 --> 25:38.357
If something goes wrong,

25:38.357 --> 25:40.147
we can't afford to take the blame.

25:40.947 --> 25:42.967
Miss, go ahead.

25:42.987 --> 25:44.347
Thanks.

25:45.027 --> 25:46.637
Aman, stay here with Er'niu

25:46.637 --> 25:47.997
and wait for me.

25:48.157 --> 25:50.077
Er'niu, if I need you later,

25:50.077 --> 25:51.437
make sure you come in.

25:55.917 --> 25:57.997
Hey, everyone, look!

25:58.027 --> 25:59.867
Whose lady is this?

26:00.397 --> 26:02.237
Woman, there is a woman!

26:13.747 --> 26:14.587
Please.

26:14.587 --> 26:16.227
Don't waste your time.

26:16.227 --> 26:18.717
I won't say a word.

26:26.077 --> 26:28.827
Can't force it, so now you're playing nice?

26:30.437 --> 26:32.917
Time to eat!

26:33.357 --> 26:35.247
Food is ready, ready!

26:35.267 --> 26:37.057
Junior Sister, hurry up!

26:37.077 --> 26:39.107
Come eat.

26:42.077 --> 26:43.827
Junior Sister,

26:44.227 --> 26:45.687
quick, come over here.

26:45.707 --> 26:46.767
Sit down.

26:46.787 --> 26:47.687
Look,

26:47.707 --> 26:49.587
what did I prepare for you?

26:56.227 --> 26:57.917
These are my hometown's specialties.

26:57.917 --> 26:59.307
Exactly.

26:59.547 --> 27:01.077
I bet you're drooling over them.

27:01.077 --> 27:02.717
Dig in while they're hot!

27:02.877 --> 27:04.277
Thank you.

27:04.597 --> 27:06.767
I've noticed

27:06.787 --> 27:09.137
you've been dejected these days.

27:09.157 --> 27:12.107
I'm sure it's because you're homesick.

27:12.837 --> 27:15.027
Perhaps your hometown's food

27:15.027 --> 27:16.627
will ease your heartache.

27:17.787 --> 27:19.197
Thank you.

27:19.597 --> 27:20.507
But, Senior,

27:20.507 --> 27:21.577
where did you

27:21.597 --> 27:23.027
get all this food?

27:23.027 --> 27:24.387
This...

27:25.117 --> 27:26.707
I abducted a few cooks from Dazhou

27:26.707 --> 27:27.967
to cook for us.

27:27.987 --> 27:29.037
Abducted?

27:29.057 --> 27:29.947
Don't worry.

27:29.947 --> 27:31.447
I'll make sure

27:31.467 --> 27:32.877
they go back in one piece,

27:32.877 --> 27:34.237
ok?

27:34.747 --> 27:35.687
Ok.

27:35.707 --> 27:37.187
Senior, eat with me.

27:37.187 --> 27:38.547
Ok.

27:38.947 --> 27:40.387
Come on.

27:44.377 --> 27:46.977
(Zhou)

27:50.677 --> 27:52.487
There's a Palace Woman with the Food Service

27:52.507 --> 27:53.867
named Aling!

27:54.057 --> 27:57.137
(Aling)

28:04.397 --> 28:06.487
Listen to me,

28:06.507 --> 28:08.827
torture won't work.

28:09.507 --> 28:11.067
Neither will

28:11.437 --> 28:13.067
a honey-trap.

28:13.917 --> 28:16.197
Sang Qi, tell me.

28:16.677 --> 28:18.787
What are you plotting to do

28:19.317 --> 28:21.377
during His Majesty's autumn hunting?

28:21.397 --> 28:22.927
Our plot?

28:22.947 --> 28:27.627
Get rid of that old fart, Jingming, for good.

28:29.317 --> 28:30.437
If you tell me

28:30.437 --> 28:31.727
the details of your plan,

28:31.747 --> 28:33.987
perhaps Commandant Yu will spare your life.

28:33.987 --> 28:35.377
No way!

28:35.397 --> 28:37.377
You lackey of Dazhou,

28:37.397 --> 28:39.187
I'm your sworn enemy!

28:39.187 --> 28:40.437
Are you really ready to die?

28:40.437 --> 28:41.747
I came here unafraid to die.

28:41.747 --> 28:43.677
But have you considered your clansmen?

28:44.637 --> 28:46.867
And your senior brothers and sisters?

28:49.947 --> 28:51.917
- None of your business!
- How dare you!

28:52.157 --> 28:53.517
You!

28:56.267 --> 28:58.107
Sang Qi, listen to me.

28:58.187 --> 28:59.787
I can get you out of here.

29:03.117 --> 29:04.967
The Capital Security has razed

29:04.987 --> 29:07.197
your gambling den at Tianxiang House

29:07.507 --> 29:09.197
and obliterated all your bases.

29:09.507 --> 29:10.577
As for your fellow members

29:10.597 --> 29:11.817
of the Nightingale Division?

29:11.837 --> 29:13.447
Dead or fled.

29:13.467 --> 29:15.207
Yet here you are, still stubborn.

29:15.227 --> 29:16.437
Don't try to fool me.

29:16.437 --> 29:17.797
Tell me

29:17.947 --> 29:19.717
where your black scorpion is.

29:37.877 --> 29:39.237
Fine.

29:39.707 --> 29:41.517
Since you won't talk,

29:42.547 --> 29:43.997
I'll tell you this.

29:44.227 --> 29:45.927
Sooner or later, someone will talk.

29:45.947 --> 29:47.447
Your plan

29:47.467 --> 29:49.237
is doomed to fail.

29:51.397 --> 29:53.277
Officer, let's go.

30:05.987 --> 30:07.247
(Senior, )

30:07.267 --> 30:08.377
(this time, )

30:08.397 --> 30:10.307
(I will choose a different path.)

30:10.547 --> 30:12.147
(After you escape, )

30:12.357 --> 30:14.067
(may we never be enemies again.)

30:33.397 --> 30:34.757
Miss,

30:35.637 --> 30:37.207
is this handkerchief yours?

30:37.227 --> 30:39.577
Sir, it isn't mine.

30:39.597 --> 30:41.307
You must be mistaken.

30:41.547 --> 30:42.917
How could I be mistaken?

30:42.917 --> 30:44.527
I saw you drop it just now.

30:44.547 --> 30:46.337
Did you throw it on purpose?

30:46.357 --> 30:47.337
Look,

30:47.357 --> 30:48.857
my handkerchief is right here.

30:48.877 --> 30:49.817
I haven't lost it.

30:49.837 --> 30:50.787
I saw clearly

30:50.787 --> 30:52.137
that it was yours.

30:52.157 --> 30:53.227
There are witnesses here.

30:53.227 --> 30:54.857
Don't think I'm harassing you.

30:54.877 --> 30:56.027
No, it isn't.

30:56.027 --> 30:57.387
Mr. Yu.

30:57.597 --> 30:58.957
Mr. Zhen.

30:59.467 --> 31:00.837
She says

31:00.837 --> 31:02.617
the handkerchief isn't hers.

31:02.637 --> 31:03.837
Why are you still harassing her?

31:03.837 --> 31:05.617
How am I harassing her?

31:05.637 --> 31:07.437
I saw her drop it,

31:07.437 --> 31:08.857
so I picked it up to return it.

31:08.857 --> 31:09.747
But think about it,

31:09.747 --> 31:11.577
if others see this,

31:11.597 --> 31:13.227
how can she still work here?

31:13.227 --> 31:15.277
- Then how can I still...
- What's wrong?

31:21.597 --> 31:22.487
What are you doing?

31:22.507 --> 31:24.147
Wasting time here?

31:24.597 --> 31:25.437
Secretary,

31:25.437 --> 31:27.487
this gentleman found a handkerchief

31:27.507 --> 31:29.137
and insists it's mine.

31:29.157 --> 31:30.207
This is a minor matter.

31:30.227 --> 31:31.767
We can sort it out later.

31:31.787 --> 31:33.587
This is not a minor matter.

31:33.747 --> 31:35.437
It concerns my reputation.

31:36.027 --> 31:37.867
Mr. Yu is right.

31:38.787 --> 31:40.547
Miss, if this handkerchief

31:40.547 --> 31:41.467
isn't yours,

31:41.467 --> 31:43.167
and he took the opportunity to harass you,

31:43.187 --> 31:45.317
I will not let him off easily.

31:45.317 --> 31:46.857
- According to Dazhou law...
- Aling,

31:46.917 --> 31:48.577
is this yours or not?

31:48.597 --> 31:49.817
Make it clear now.

31:49.837 --> 31:51.677
Don't delay their or our official duties.

31:51.677 --> 31:52.707
The banquet is about to begin.

31:52.707 --> 31:54.237
We must be there quickly.

31:59.787 --> 32:01.307
It's mine!

32:01.787 --> 32:03.677
She admitted it herself.

32:06.747 --> 32:08.007
I'll ask you again.

32:08.027 --> 32:10.237
Is this handkerchief yours?

32:11.027 --> 32:12.967
It is indeed mine.

32:12.987 --> 32:14.707
I rushed to deliver refreshments

32:14.707 --> 32:15.637
and didn't check carefully.

32:15.637 --> 32:16.527
Secretary,

32:16.547 --> 32:18.577
she admitted it herself.

32:18.597 --> 32:20.437
But there's poison

32:20.547 --> 32:21.997
in this handkerchief.

32:24.467 --> 32:26.617
I... This isn't mine.

32:26.637 --> 32:27.707
Mine carries no poison!

32:27.707 --> 32:29.297
You just said it was yours.

32:29.317 --> 32:30.857
Now you're saying it isn't.

32:30.877 --> 32:32.787
Are you hiding something?

32:33.267 --> 32:34.207
Guards,

32:34.227 --> 32:35.587
search her!

32:47.267 --> 32:48.677
What is this?

32:50.437 --> 32:52.357
Sir, I didn't want to do this!

32:52.357 --> 32:54.187
They forced me to poison His Majesty!

32:54.187 --> 32:55.547
Sir!

32:56.077 --> 32:58.337
Sir, I truly had no idea!

32:58.357 --> 32:59.717
Secretary,

32:59.947 --> 33:02.487
you know the procedure.

33:02.507 --> 33:03.487
Understood.

33:03.507 --> 33:04.987
Bind her and take her away.

33:04.987 --> 33:06.297
Spare me, sir!

33:06.317 --> 33:08.747
They forced me, sir!

33:08.747 --> 33:10.337
Spare me, sir!

33:10.357 --> 33:13.587
I didn't do it, sir!

33:13.747 --> 33:15.197
Today,

33:15.677 --> 33:17.307
I went against my principles.

33:17.917 --> 33:20.817
I cracked my first case without evidence.

33:20.837 --> 33:22.827
But I believe you did the right thing.

33:26.027 --> 33:28.307
His Majesty has arrived!

33:45.187 --> 33:47.277
Bow!

33:50.467 --> 33:54.387
Long live Your Majesty!

33:57.627 --> 33:58.917
Bow once more!

33:58.917 --> 34:01.917
May Your Majesty be in perfect health!

34:04.667 --> 34:06.547
Rise, all my ministers.

34:09.277 --> 34:10.957
The howling wind

34:11.437 --> 34:14.777
highlights your valiant spirits

34:14.797 --> 34:17.547
and honors the splendor of Dazhou.

34:55.027 --> 34:59.837
Long live Your Majesty!

35:13.017 --> 35:16.537
(Capital Security Office)

35:44.547 --> 35:46.187
How come there's such a strong wind?

35:46.187 --> 35:48.257
(Zhou)

35:57.467 --> 35:59.707
Why is the wind blowing so hard?

36:11.497 --> 36:13.897
(Zhou)

36:13.917 --> 36:15.647
Why is it raining?

36:15.667 --> 36:17.437
My spices!

36:17.437 --> 36:18.647
Aman!

36:18.667 --> 36:20.107
It's not raining.

36:20.197 --> 36:21.817
It's a solar eclipse.

36:21.837 --> 36:23.667
Solar eclipse?

36:34.297 --> 36:36.097
(Zhou)

36:43.107 --> 36:44.837
Aman, what time is it now?

36:44.837 --> 36:47.417
- Just past the Wu Hour.
- Just past?

36:47.437 --> 36:49.027
(Isn't it three quarters past the Wu hour?)

36:49.027 --> 36:50.147
(Was I mistaken?)

36:50.147 --> 36:51.217
(Could it)

36:51.237 --> 36:52.417
(have another meaning?)

36:52.437 --> 36:54.397
(Oh no, we've made a mistake!)

36:54.397 --> 36:55.337
(Yu Qi, )

36:55.357 --> 36:57.267
(please stay safe!)

37:04.587 --> 37:05.997
Protect His Majesty!

37:06.507 --> 37:08.147
Hurry, protect His Majesty!

37:08.357 --> 37:10.797
Protect His Majesty!

37:12.357 --> 37:13.717
Protect His Majesty!

37:23.067 --> 37:25.387
- Watch out, Your Majesty!
- Brazen assassin! Seize him!

37:25.397 --> 37:27.747
Solar eclipse! Light the candles!

37:30.107 --> 37:31.627
- Mr. Yu!
- Your Majesty.

37:32.917 --> 37:34.277
Hurry!

37:35.027 --> 37:36.387
Don't move.

37:41.627 --> 37:43.187
Who are you?

37:43.917 --> 37:47.227
Yu Qi, Commandant of the Capital Security.

37:52.717 --> 37:54.127
Summon the imperial physician.

37:54.147 --> 37:56.707
Send for the imperial physician!

38:22.877 --> 38:24.237
Thanks.

38:30.837 --> 38:32.227
How is his injury?

38:33.037 --> 38:34.667
Your Majesty,

38:34.757 --> 38:36.527
despite the protection of his soft armor,

38:36.547 --> 38:38.817
he has numerous old injuries.

38:38.837 --> 38:41.377
The recent strike has aggravated them.

38:41.397 --> 38:43.927
His internal injuries are grave.

38:43.947 --> 38:45.587
He must get proper care and rest,

38:45.627 --> 38:48.587
otherwise, they may root permanently.

38:50.237 --> 38:51.667
I shall take my leave.

39:04.317 --> 39:05.677
Your Majesty.

39:05.717 --> 39:07.397
Why are you still calling me that?

39:07.587 --> 39:08.947
Don't stand on ceremony.

39:10.917 --> 39:12.277
I shall take my leave.

39:12.837 --> 39:14.027
Do you truly believe

39:14.027 --> 39:14.947
I couldn't even

39:14.947 --> 39:16.317
recognize my own son?

39:21.947 --> 39:23.627
The 7th Prince,

39:24.027 --> 39:25.547
Yu Jin?

39:27.547 --> 39:29.587
Every year, I had someone

39:30.357 --> 39:31.757
send your latest portraits

39:31.757 --> 39:34.067
from the army,

39:35.197 --> 39:37.587
just to see your face more often.

39:41.107 --> 39:41.957
Jin,

39:41.957 --> 39:43.587
(Yu Jin, 7th Prince of Dazhou)

39:43.587 --> 39:44.957
all these years,

39:45.667 --> 39:48.587
you've weighed heavily on my heart.

39:52.667 --> 39:54.547
Come, how is your injury?

39:54.547 --> 39:55.907
Let me see.

40:08.357 --> 40:10.447
His Majesty has arrived!

40:10.467 --> 40:13.107
We deserve death ten thousandfold.

40:13.107 --> 40:15.747
We await Your Majesty's punishment.

40:15.837 --> 40:17.467
The Imperial Guard failed in vigilance,

40:17.487 --> 40:19.217
allowing the assassin to infiltrate the hunt.

40:19.237 --> 40:21.697
No death can atone for my fault.

40:21.717 --> 40:23.817
The Speed Guards arrived too late.

40:23.837 --> 40:26.067
I also deserve death.

40:26.797 --> 40:28.157
Your Majesty,

40:28.507 --> 40:29.467
Commandant Yu

40:29.467 --> 40:31.317
engaged the assassin.

40:31.547 --> 40:33.147
Does he have any clues?

40:35.197 --> 40:36.547
I believe the assassin

40:36.547 --> 40:38.257
is still here.

40:38.277 --> 40:39.337
Your Majesty,

40:39.357 --> 40:40.287
the Imperial Guard has

40:40.287 --> 40:41.567
surrounded the hunting grounds.

40:41.587 --> 40:43.547
We will surely capture him.

40:44.757 --> 40:46.117
Your Majesty,

40:46.147 --> 40:47.567
by royal decree,

40:47.587 --> 40:48.947
all officials are barred from entering

40:48.947 --> 40:50.607
the hunting grounds with iron weapons.

40:50.627 --> 40:51.927
All hunting tools

40:51.947 --> 40:53.487
are distributed on-site.

40:53.507 --> 40:54.757
Before entering,

40:54.757 --> 40:56.417
the officials

40:56.437 --> 40:57.587
underwent rigorous inspections

40:57.587 --> 40:59.317
to ensure they carried no iron pieces.

40:59.507 --> 41:01.917
Only the Imperial Guard and Speed Guards...

41:05.107 --> 41:06.927
You may not

41:06.947 --> 41:08.627
uncover anything on your own.

41:08.797 --> 41:10.837
Yu is proven loyalty in protecting me.

41:11.087 --> 41:12.587
This investigation is yours.

41:12.947 --> 41:15.797
Your Majesty, I request Mr Zhen's assistance.

41:15.877 --> 41:17.237
Granted.

41:22.147 --> 41:24.837
Everyone, drench yourselves

41:24.837 --> 41:26.317
with the water

41:26.437 --> 41:28.397
in your buckets.

41:29.397 --> 41:30.757
Why?

41:33.197 --> 41:34.557
Imperial Insignia Guard,

41:34.797 --> 41:36.157
drench!

41:39.917 --> 41:42.267
Speed Guards, drench!

41:48.397 --> 41:49.357
When I fought

41:49.357 --> 41:51.107
the assassin earlier,

41:51.437 --> 41:53.837
I crushed a fragrant pellet in my hand

41:54.067 --> 41:56.517
and struck him in the chest.

41:56.947 --> 42:01.267
The hidden mark reacts to water.

42:02.237 --> 42:04.107
Everyone, examine each other now.

42:04.397 --> 42:05.757
Oh...

42:07.107 --> 42:08.957
- Nothing.
- Nothing on me either.

42:11.627 --> 42:13.437
There's nothing.

42:18.717 --> 42:21.667
What's on your chest?

42:24.337 --> 42:26.977
(Wang Heng)

42:27.587 --> 42:29.837
Merely a stain

42:29.837 --> 42:31.487
I accidentally got.

42:31.507 --> 42:32.867
Jiang Zhan!

42:43.577 --> 42:47.857
(The End of Episode 22)

42:48.308 --> 42:50.038
♪ From place to place ♪

42:50.038 --> 42:54.978
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

42:55.348 --> 42:57.728
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

42:57.728 --> 43:01.958
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:02.668 --> 43:05.068
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:05.088 --> 43:08.748
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:08.768 --> 43:12.188
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:12.338 --> 43:17.858
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:18.678 --> 43:22.358
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:22.358 --> 43:26.438
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:26.678 --> 43:28.418
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:28.438 --> 43:33.138
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:33.138 --> 43:36.708
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:36.728 --> 43:40.958
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:40.978 --> 43:42.758
♪ Time glows ♪

43:42.758 --> 43:47.298
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:47.318 --> 43:52.118
♪ And stars ♪

43:56.348 --> 43:58.878
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

43:58.898 --> 44:02.518
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:02.538 --> 44:05.968
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:05.988 --> 44:10.608
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:10.608 --> 44:14.298
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:14.318 --> 44:18.408
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:18.518 --> 44:20.338
♪ Time glows ♪

44:20.338 --> 44:24.888
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:24.908 --> 44:28.608
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:28.628 --> 44:32.788
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:32.968 --> 44:34.728
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:34.728 --> 44:39.248
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:39.248 --> 44:42.888
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:42.908 --> 44:48.578
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:50.268 --> 44:52.198
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:52.198 --> 44:59.698
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
